      "headline": "GPT‑6 Astra",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "3rd September 2026 - Link Blog GPT‑6 Astra (via) GPT-6 Astra is \"rolling out today to a limited set of organizations and over the coming days will become available to all ChatGPT Plus, Pro, Business, and Enterprise users, as well as through the OpenAI API and AWS\" - I've not trie",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-04T08:05:21.341129+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "abadd71e24bd608b53dcc4564d702eb8a8767402964955093add5a405e4cba51",
          "excerpt": "3rd September 2026 - Link Blog GPT‑6 Astra (via) GPT-6 Astra is \"rolling out today to a limited set of organizations and over the coming days will become available to all ChatGPT Plus, Pro, Business, and Enterprise users, as well as through the OpenAI API and AWS\" - I've not trie",
          "sentence_hash": "f36f6199f0b2772cb1ddcba0be67ecc9754babf15171e89af3189303bf254e32",
          "anchors": [
            "September 20"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "It's going to be API priced at the same rate as Claude Fable 5 and 5.1: $10/million input and $50/million output.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-04T08:05:21.341174+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "abadd71e24bd608b53dcc4564d702eb8a8767402964955093add5a405e4cba51",
          "excerpt": "It's going to be API priced at the same rate as Claude Fable 5 and 5.1: $10/million input and $50/million output.",
          "sentence_hash": "06effa33297c3c70c2fad102cf7d46958cb95a61c27b3372b2d9610a9295760d",
          "anchors": [
            "$50",
            "$10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "This is clearly OpenAI's Fable competitor, and appears to score higher than Fable on most of OpenAI's self-reported benchmarks.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-04T08:05:21.341204+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "abadd71e24bd608b53dcc4564d702eb8a8767402964955093add5a405e4cba51",
          "excerpt": "This is clearly OpenAI's Fable competitor, and appears to score higher than Fable on most of OpenAI's self-reported benchmarks.",
          "sentence_hash": "fc4e59d0b69ef11753c517e10535fbadd430174f2a7a0e834ec65d57b626bd99",
          "anchors": [
            "most",
            "bench"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Most impressively, Astra scores 99.9% on the recent (released in March) ARC-AGI 3 benchmark - though notably Fable 5 does not yet have a published result, and the ARC-AGI blog notes that the 99.9% score was achieved for $19K using OpenAI's custom \"Provider Adapter harness\", while",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-04T08:05:21.341251+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "abadd71e24bd608b53dcc4564d702eb8a8767402964955093add5a405e4cba51",
          "excerpt": "Most impressively, Astra scores 99.9% on the recent (released in March) ARC-AGI 3 benchmark - though notably Fable 5 does not yet have a published result, and the ARC-AGI blog notes that the 99.9% score was achieved for $19K using OpenAI's custom \"Provider Adapter harness\", while",
          "sentence_hash": "218d4648d0d25efe35881b9ca0050a4e6e6b01f452d61a0221cf0abf321f04d2",
          "anchors": [
            "$26",
            "$19",
            "62.7%",
            "99.9%",
            "arc",
            "recent",
            "bench"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "The Provider Adapter harness preserves opaque reasoning state between requests and uses compaction for longer conversations, allowing the model to reuse prior work.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-04T08:05:21.341284+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "abadd71e24bd608b53dcc4564d702eb8a8767402964955093add5a405e4cba51",
          "excerpt": "The Provider Adapter harness preserves opaque reasoning state between requests and uses compaction for longer conversations, allowing the model to reuse prior work.",
          "sentence_hash": "256699131e6a717f86fbd83fc1e51d5b61eb2b2e4c69e4030b1b48926be5f4c1",
          "anchors": [
            "work"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "Unsurprisingly, given the recent Hugging Face incident, Astra is a beast at security tasks.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-04T08:05:21.341308+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "abadd71e24bd608b53dcc4564d702eb8a8767402964955093add5a405e4cba51",
          "excerpt": "Unsurprisingly, given the recent Hugging Face incident, Astra is a beast at security tasks.",
          "sentence_hash": "b378f35ec0e7abbfdf6bcd0f674f6b14d3ea7990ec31224becb78a793a6c073e",
          "anchors": [
            "recent"
          ]
